    {
      "id": "1407",
      "type": "related_content",
      "attributes": {
        "id": 1407,
        "relationship_type": "related",
        "body": "化する and ～になる・～くなる both express change. 化する attaches to nouns and means '~ify' or '~ize', e.g. データ化する 'to digitize' (literally, 'to turn into data'). ～になる and ～くなる are more general-purpose ways to express becoming something, e.g. 綺麗になる 'become clean' or 白くなる 'to become white'.",
